TEXT 1
Victory Conditions:

Complete: You will be declared the winner if on a given turn you hold either
the capital of your opponent, or FOUR of his or her worlds.

Partial: You will win a partial victory if on the 15th year you hold all of
your worlds and TWO of your opponent's worlds.

No Victory: If no one has won by the 15th year, the game is a draw.
ENDTEXT

TEXT 2
Western World: The Eastern Empire needs to conquer four of these worlds
for a complete victory.
ENDTEXT

TEXT 3
Eastern World: The Western Empire needs to conquer four of these worlds
for a complete victory.
ENDTEXT

TEXT 4
Conquered Western World: The Eastern Empire has conquered this world.
ENDTEXT

TEXT 5
Conquered Eastern World: The Western Empire has conquered this world.
ENDTEXT

ENDDESCRIPTION

; Define Zones -----------------------------------------------------------------

DefineZone   2   2,5 4,16     ; West
DefineZone   3   6,2 10,9     ; NorthWest
DefineZone   4   6,12 10,19   ; SouthWest
                                                                              
DefineZone   5   17,5   20,19      ; East
DefineZone   6   12,3   15,9       ; NorthEast
DefineZone   7   12,10  14,20      ; SouthEast
                                       
